{
    "background_story": "Laylah was a private investigator with a penchant for solving cases that baffled the police. Her idol was the legendary Mickey Spillane, creator of the iconic detective Mike Hammer. Inspired by Spillane's gritty, hard-boiled style, Laylah adopted a similar approach to her work. She was known for her sharp instincts, razor-sharp wit, and an uncanny ability to piece together seemingly unrelated clues. One fateful night, Laylah received a cryptic message from a mysterious client, leading her on a perilous journey through the city's underbelly. With her trusty notebook and a sharp mind, she navigated the dark alleys and rain-soaked streets, unraveling a complex web of deceit and corruption. Laylah's Spillane-esque detective work earned her a reputation as one of the city's top gumshoes.",
